---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-border bg-surface-alt px-4 py-8 dark:border-border-dark dark:bg-surface-dark-alt">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
    <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-text-muted dark:text-text-dark-muted">Wager on Weather</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-text-muted dark:text-text-dark-muted">
          Weather intelligence for sports and weather markets. Hourly and 15-day
          forecasts for 41,000+ US ZIP codes and 300+ venues across MLB, NFL,
          NCAA, MLS, and more.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-text-muted dark:text-text-dark-muted">Navigation</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-1 text-sm">
          <li><a href="/" class="text-text-muted hover:text-field dark:text-text-dark-muted dark:hover:text-field-light">Home</a></li>
          <li><a href="/bettheforecast" class="text-text-muted hover:text-field dark:text-text-dark-muted dark:hover:text-field-light">Bet the Forecast</a></li>
          <li><a href="/venues" class="text-text-muted hover:text-field dark:text-text-dark-muted dark:hover:text-field-light">Venues</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-text-muted dark:text-text-dark-muted">Data Sources</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-1 text-sm">
          <li><span class="text-text-muted dark:text-text-dark-muted">Forecasts: produced by Wager on Weather</span></li>
          <li><span class="text-text-muted dark:text-text-dark-muted">Observations &amp; market settlement: National Weather Service</span></li>
          <li><span class="text-text-muted dark:text-text-dark-muted">Radar: RainViewer &middot; NEXRAD via Iowa State Mesonet</span></li>
          <li><span class="text-text-muted dark:text-text-dark-muted">Geocoding: OpenStreetMap Nominatim</span></li>
          <li><span class="text-text-muted dark:text-text-dark-muted">Maps: OpenStreetMap &middot; CARTO &middot; Leaflet</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!--
      The "Powered by WeatherNext 2" block was removed 2026-07-29. It credited
      Google DeepMind's WeatherNext 2 and advertised 64 ensemble members at
      0.25-degree resolution, but WeatherNext has never served a customer
      forecast: resolveForecastProvider() defaults to open-meteo, and the
      weathernext paths fail closed with endpoint_unconfirmed and fall back.
      Claiming a model we do not run — on a site people wager against — is a
      misrepresentation, so the whole block and its stats are gone rather than
      reworded.
    -->
    <div class="mt-8 border-t border-border pt-6 dark:border-border-dark">
      <p class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center text-xs text-text-muted dark:text-text-dark-muted">
        Forecasts on this site are produced by Wager on Weather and cover the next
        15 days, hourly for the near term. Weather markets settle on documented
        National Weather Service observations for the stated location and date —
        never on our own forecast.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-6 border-t border-border pt-4 text-center text-xs text-text-muted dark:border-border-dark dark:text-text-dark-muted">
      &copy; {year} Wager on Weather. Weather data is provided for informational purposes only.
      Always follow official weather warnings and local authority guidance.
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
